<title>AUSTRIA: SOCCER-MANCHESTER UNITED 2 RAPID O - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MANCHESTER UNITED 2 RAPID O - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manchester United of England beat Rapid Vienna of Austria 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in their European champions' league group C match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers - Ryan Giggs 24, Eric Cantona 72</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
